type: dataset
title: 'Caregiving Jobs vs. AI: Projections, Wages and AI-Exposure Scores for Elder-Care Occupations'
abstract: BLS 2025-35 employment projections, OEWS May 2025 wages and four AI-exposure/care measures (BLS relative AI exposure, Microsoft AI applicability, Anthropic observed exposure, O*NET 'Assisting and Caring for Others') for 14 hands-on care occupations and 11 high-exposure office/tech comparison occupations.
